elopment Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Academic pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","MA","Research Assistant","PhD","Postdoctoral/Researcher","Faculty/Research Scientist"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD Routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential fields include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD in Gender Studies"},{"text":"PhD in Women's Studies"},{"text":"PhD in Sociology"},{"text":"PhD in Development Studies"},{"text":"PhD in Social Work"},{"text":"PhD in Economics"},{"text":"PhD in Political Science"},{"text":"PhD in Public Policy"},{"text":"PhD in Population Studies"},{"text":"PhD in Public Health"},{"text":"PhD in Rural Development"},{"text":"PhD in Anthropology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research topics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Women's labour-force participation"},{"text":"Gender wage inequality"},{"text":"Unpaid care work"},{"text":"Rural women's livelihoods"},{"text":"Gender and agriculture"},{"text":"Gender and education"},{"text":"Gender and healthcare"},{"text":"Gender-based violence"},{"text":"Women's political participation"},{"text":"Digital gender divide"},{"text":"Gender and climate change"},{"text":"Gender and migration"},{"text":"Gender and AI"},{"text":"Gender bias in algorithms"},{"text":"Women in STEM"},{"text":"Gender and platform work"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2035–2046","text":"Long-Term Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future Gender Researcher will increasingly be a social researcher who can work with both qualitative evidence and large-scale data."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Gender Researcher","Senior Gender Researcher","Gender Policy Specialist","Research/Policy Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Specialist pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Data → Gender Data Scientist/Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Economics → Gender Economist"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Public Policy → Gender Policy Advisor"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Climate → Gender & Climate Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Technology → Gender & AI/Technology Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Gender + Rural Development → Rural Gender Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Gender Studies","Research Methods","Data","Fieldwork","Policy Analysis","Academic Writing","Technology","AI Literacy"],"sep":"+"}]}]}